  "title": "CoSkill: Joint Reinforcement Learning of Reasoning and Meta-Skill Agents for Hierarchical Skill Evolution",
  "summary": "CoSkill proposes a unified multi-agent RL framework that recasts the static meta-skill workflow as a learnable Meta-Skill Agent and jointly trains it with a Reasoning Agent over a hierarchical skill library, enabling end-to-end co-adaptation between agents. This framework achieves superior performance on ALFWorld and WebShop benchmarks, outperforming existing skill-based and RL baselines.",
